      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i tried that but nothing is happening. the water just sits there. if the plunger doesnt work should i try taking the pipe underneath the sink apart to see if there is something stuck in the trap? i'm kinda nervous about doing that though.",
      "source": "evaluator"
